[14Nov2026 16:10:00.529] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] ☘ Your grimoire grew a leaf - 10 to spend on its Mana Tree (open it, then the Tree ribbon).
[14Nov2026 16:10:25.524] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] ☘ Your grimoire grew a leaf - 10 to spend on its Mana Tree (open it, then the Tree ribbon).
[14Nov2026 16:10:47.342] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Ossuarch: Another one wanders into my ossuary. Stay - you'll fit right in.
[14Nov2026 16:10:58.467] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Ossuarch: You can scratch bone. Fine - let's see you cut through space.
[14Nov2026 16:11:07.234] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Ossuarch: Enough. I'll show you what was waiting under the bone.
[14Nov2026 16:11:17.284] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Ossuarch: ...So the bone remembers you. Hm.
[14Nov2026 16:11:27.416] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Beast of Despair: Hope? I'll tear it out of you. Despair is the only thing that's real.
[14Nov2026 16:11:42.211] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Beast of Despair: You made me open it... Now see what a real beast looks like.
[14Nov2026 16:11:48.501] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Beast of Despair: Struggle all you want. Everything gets swallowed by despair in the end.
[14Nov2026 16:11:54.742] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] A TORN MEMORY PAGE  drifts down from The Beast of Despair - Chapter I, page 1. Use it to read it into your grimoire.
[14Nov2026 16:11:54.786] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Beast of Despair: Hope... is only... a longer road to despair...
[14Nov2026 16:12:07.311] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Rhya: Ugh, more work... Fine. Let me see that grimoire of yours - I'll be borrowing it.
[14Nov2026 16:12:18.480] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Rhya: Alright, alright... you know I've touched a lot of grimoires, right? Captains' ones, even.
[14Nov2026 16:12:27.221] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Rhya: Fine. Then I'll copy the one magic that isn't supposed to be copied.
[14Nov2026 16:12:31.577] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Rhya: Total Copy. Everything I've touched today - all of it, at once.
[14Nov2026 16:12:32.280] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Rhya: Heh... I'm so tired... Wake me when it's over...
[14Nov2026 16:12:47.319] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Licht: You carry a grimoire... Then show me what you would protect with it.
[14Nov2026 16:12:59.715] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Licht: Not bad. This one is heavier.
[14Nov2026 16:13:10.979] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Licht: Two blades now. Keep up.
[14Nov2026 16:13:14.735] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Licht: ...Forgive me. What comes next is not light.
[14Nov2026 16:13:17.263] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Licht: So this is... how it ends. Protect what I could not.
[14Nov2026 16:13:27.326] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Revenant: Welcome, welcome. My friends here have been dying to meet you.
[14Nov2026 16:13:37.228] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Revenant: You think you can close them all? I'll just open more!
[14Nov2026 16:13:48.532] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Revenant: No... not like this... not before I get my revenge...
[14Nov2026 16:14:07.326] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Curse Witch: Heehoehoehoe! A visitor in the forest? Stay, stay - let me curse you properly!
[14Nov2026 16:14:17.216] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Curse Witch: Oh-ho! You're a tough one! Then my little ones will help - heehoehoe!
[14Nov2026 16:14:23.539] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Curse Witch: Heehoe... hoe... my curses... they're lifting...
[14Nov2026 16:15:07.251] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Cinder Sovereign: You think fire fears the rain? Burn.
[14Nov2026 16:15:12.219] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Cinder Sovereign: ENOUGH. The world beneath you is mine.
[14Nov2026 16:15:17.235] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] A TORN MEMORY PAGE  drifts down from The Cinder Sovereign - Chapter I, page 2. Use it to read it into your grimoire.
[14Nov2026 16:15:17.297] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Cinder Sovereign: No... the fire... it was mine...
[14Nov2026 16:15:17.297] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] THE CINDER SOVEREIGN FALLS  Your share: 100% - +60 merit stars, Mana Cores, a Sovereign's Ember.
[14Nov2026 16:15:17.297] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Cinder Sovereign has been brought down by Tester.
[14Nov2026 16:15:28.282] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Copyist's Echo: She wrote me to keep the books. You want her pages? Read them off me.
[14Nov2026 16:15:35.964] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Copyist's Echo: You're tearing me. That's how she made me - from torn pages.
[14Nov2026 16:15:42.213] [Server thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.world.entity.LivingEntity/]: Named entity MemoryGuardian['The Copyist's Echo'/5528, l='ServerLevel[isg_uishots_1794671229029]', x=-3.66, y=-60.00, z=8.33] died: The Copyist's Echo was slain by Tester
[14Nov2026 16:15:42.221] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] MEMORY RECOVERED  The Copyist's Echo fades into a last page. +15 merit stars.
[14Nov2026 16:15:42.221] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT]   Chapter II begins: its pages are with the great foes again.
[14Nov2026 16:15:42.287] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.advancements.AdvancementList/]: Loaded 38 advancements
[14Nov2026 16:15:42.288] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] The Copyist's Echo: ...Keep the books. Better than I did.
[14Nov2026 16:15:45.535] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] ☘ Your grimoire grew a leaf - 11 to spend on its Mana Tree (open it, then the Tree ribbon).
[14Nov2026 16:16:07.330] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Dante: Cut me, burn me, break me. I'll simply put myself back together.
[14Nov2026 16:16:20.083] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Dante: Hold still. This only takes a moment.
[14Nov2026 16:16:23.511] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Dante: ...My mana. Gone? No - not yet!
[14Nov2026 16:16:29.741] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Dante: You've seen what my body can do. Now feel how heavy the world can be.
[14Nov2026 16:16:33.475] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Dante: Enough holding back. Look upon what I borrowed from below.
[14Nov2026 16:16:36.517] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Dante: There. Whole again.
[14Nov2026 16:16:37.207] [Server thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.world.entity.LivingEntity/]: Named entity Dante['Dante - Devil's Power  [body 50%]'/5633, l='ServerLevel[isg_uishots_1794671229029]', x=-3.50, y=-60.00, z=22.43] died: Dante - Devil's Power  [body 50%] was slain by Tester
[14Nov2026 16:16:37.283] [Render thread/INFO] [net.minecraft.client.gui.components.ChatComponent/]: [System] [CHAT] Dante: It won't close... why won't it close...
